[{"id": "17", "text": "$4$축의 방정식이 $x=2$ 이므로 $y=a\\left( x-2\\right) ^{2}+q$두 점 $\\left( -2,~1\\right) ,~\\left( 4,~4\\right)$를 대입하게 되면$\\begin{cases} 1=16a+q & \\\\ 4=4a+q & \\end{cases}$ $\\therefore ~a=-\\frac{1}{4},~q=5$$y=-\\frac{1}{4}\\left( x-2\\right) ^{2}+5$$y=-\\frac{1}{4}x^{2}+x+4$.   $a=-\\frac{1}{4},~b=1,~c=4$따라서 $4a+b+c=4\\times \\left( -\\frac{1}{4}\\right) +1+4=4$", "spans": 10}, {"id": "18", "text": "$a=1$$y=ax^{2}-4ax+a^{2}+2a=a\\left( x-2\\right) ^{2}+a^{2}-2a$꼭짓점의 좌표는 $\\left( 2,~a^{2}-2a\\right)$ ,  $a^{2}-2a=-1$  $\\left( a-1\\right) ^{2}=0$   $\\therefore ~a=1$", "spans": 6}, {"id": "19", "text": "⑴ $\\mathrm{\\overline{AD}}=15\\sqrt{3}(m)$, $\\mathrm{\\overline{CD}}=15(m)$                ⑵ $\\mathrm{\\overline{BD}}=30(m)$, $\\mathrm{\\overline{AB}}=15\\sqrt{7}(m)$⑴ $\\mathrm{\\overline{AD}}=30\\times \\sin \\,60°=30\\times \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}=15\\sqrt{3}$   $\\mathrm{\\overline{CD}}=30\\times \\cos \\,60°=30\\times \\frac{1}{2}=15$⑵ $\\mathrm{\\overline{BD}}=\\overline{BC}-\\overline{CD}=45-15=30$   $\\mathrm{\\overline{AB}}=\\sqrt{\\left( \\overline{AD}\\right) ^{2}+\\left( \\overline{BD}\\right) ^{2}}=\\sqrt{\\left( 15\\sqrt{3}\\right) ^{2}+30^{2}}=\\sqrt{1575}=15\\sqrt{7}$", "spans": 8}, {"id": "20", "text": "$71.4\\,\\mathrm{m}$$\\mathrm{\\angle }CAB=50°$. $\\mathrm{\\overline{BC}}=60\\times \\tan \\,50°=60\\times 1.19=71.4$", "spans": 3}]